# a hex board with a view (docs/VIEWS.md): its page draws the hexes, and choosing an empty one places your colour
of: record
form: <<END
name: text 1..64
size: natural 3..11
END
head: {name}
voice: a board of hexes on a table, colours set down one at a time and never lifted
about: a board of hexes anyone sets their colour on, one hex a turn, drawn live on its page
body: hexboard
